ways - European Union\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"a8e089d0fe588e2f\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/view/tran_sf_railsu/default/table\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"0b4c7a358a5b3567\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n{{navtreeTabShown | uppercase}} · Toast-notifications available (click to show all) · ({{notificationCount}}) · Go back to the LIVE environment · PREVIEW EC data browser\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"0b4c7a358a5b3567\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"ec.europa.eu\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}], "details": {"query": "\"tran_sf_railsu\" csv download Eurostat", "provider": "brave", "count": 5, "tookMs": 876, "externalContent": {"untrusted": true, "source": "web_search", "provider": "brave", "wrapped": true}, "results": [{"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"8b166acc5555b983\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n[tran_sf_railsu] Suicides involving railways - European Commission\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"8b166acc5555b983\">>>", "url": "https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/databrowser/view/tran_sf_railsu/default/table?lang=en&category=tran.tran_sf.tran_sf_rail", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"368ea0f2a9ecf993\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n{{navtreeTabShown | uppercase}} · Toast-notifications available (click to show all) · ({{notificationCount}}) · Go back to the LIVE environment · PREVIEW EC data browser\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"368ea0f2a9ecf993\">>>", "siteName": "ec.europa.eu"}, {"title": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"d3ec912f0862038b\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nRailway safety statistics in the EU - Statistics Explained - Eurostat\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"d3ec912f0862038b\">>>", "url": "https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/statistics-explained/index.php?title=Railway_safety_statistics_in_the_EU", "description": "\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"b6c3fd00ebb6ee94\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nThis